republic-function.logic.r1: argue/equivocates: P5 (S16): "well" is taken as fares well, prospers, is blessed and happy in P5 and as performs the soul's function of living excellently, as a good instance of its kind where lives_well is used else, a reader says: the argument holds only if they are one; taken apart, C2 (S18) does not follow (republic-function.logic.r1.sense1)
republic-function.logic.r1: argue/countermodel: C2 (S18): D = {another}; happy = ∅, just = {another}, lives_well = {another}, lives_well_2 = ∅
